# macOS
.DS_Store

# Generated deployment copy of the power.
# Produced from the tracked sources by the "Copy to Deploy" hook in .kiro/hooks/.
# Never edit deploy/ directly — edit POWER.md, README.md, mcp.json or steering/*.md.
deploy/

# Working reference material: sample reports, questionnaires, recordings, drafts.
# Large binaries (.docx, .xlsx, .mp4) and customer-derived content — keep out of git.
ref/

# Local Kiro settings, which may contain machine-specific or credential-bearing MCP config.
.kiro/settings/

# Everything else under .kiro/ IS tracked deliberately:
#   .kiro/hooks/    — deploy-sync and README automation, including the workspace-anchored
#                     matchers and scope guards. Costly to rediscover; see git history.
#   .kiro/steering/ — analyzer-ground-rules.md binds anyone editing this repo. Its report-facing
#                     rules are also mirrored into steering/report-structure.md so they reach
#                     end users of the installed power.
#   .kiro/specs/    — the design record for significant changes (requirements, design, tasks).
